{"title": "Shar's Umbrae", "pageid": 28276, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shar's_Umbrae", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Shar's Umbrae</b> is a passive feature that helps the wearer stay undetected.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While <a href=\"/wiki/Obscured\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obscured\">obscured</a>, the wearer has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth Checks</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_(Rare)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Half-Plate (Rare)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_(Rare)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Half-Plate (Rare)\">Dark Justiciar Half-Plate</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_(Very_Rare)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Half-Plate (Very Rare)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_(Very_Rare)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Half-Plate (Very Rare)\">Dark Justiciar Half-Plate</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Viconia%27s_Priestess_Robe\" title=\"Viconia's Priestess Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Viconia%27s_Priestess_Robe_Unfaded_icon.png/30px-Viconia%27s_Priestess_Robe_Unfaded_icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Viconia%27s_Priestess_Robe_Unfaded_icon.png/45px-Viconia%27s_Priestess_Robe_Unfaded_icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Viconia%27s_Priestess_Robe_Unfaded_icon.png/60px-Viconia%27s_Priestess_Robe_Unfaded_icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Viconia%27s_Priestess_Robe_Unfaded_icon.png/30px-Viconia%27s_Priestess_Robe_Unfaded_icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Viconia%27s_Priestess_Robe_Unfaded_icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Viconia%27s_Priestess_Robe\" title=\"Viconia's Priestess Robe\">Viconia's Priestess Robe</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Shar's Umbrae</b> applies its Advantage on Stealth checks without any obscurity level checks, even if in a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clear_Area_(Condition)\" title=\"Clear Area (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Co